header='''# Dark Psychology vs. Healthy Boundaries: How to Spot Emotional Manipulation
## Complete image-prompt bundle — thumbnail excluded
Scope: 16:9 episode only. Provisional 21 scene sheets (189 panels), plus one shared three-sheet animation kit. Based on 2,575 script words at approximately 155 words/minute; adjust only missing art after final narration is measured. No Shorts or thumbnail requests.

Attach the canonical stickman reference to every character/scene request. Existing inspected assets: assets/stickman.jpeg and assets/subscribe-end-card.jpeg from verified benchmark commit 24482a17b033efb8c7bffadc4691e8519e446c96. Reuse neutral front/three-quarter/side/back, seated writing and running poses where suitable; reuse end card unchanged. No separate shared animation-kit library was located in the checked sources; cross-project storage remains pending.

Scene sheet canvas: highest supported 16:9 resolution, ideally 4608×2592. Nine equal 16:9 panels in each 3×3 sheet. P01–P09 always run left-to-right, top-to-bottom; filename S01.png etc. Every prompt is standalone. Left/Right indicates where the principal subject sits; keep the opposite side open and bottom 20% clear WITHIN EACH PANEL. Secondary people wear plain neutral clothing, same scale and human dignity: no evil faces or diagnostic stereotypes. Text, numbers, precise clocks, arrows and diagram geometry are added during editing, never generated into the art.

Kit canvas: 3072×3072 or largest supported square; no landscape panel crops. Final composition safe zones do not apply to kit cells. All kit IDs are outside the images; do not generate labels. Keep new artwork with this episode until extracted assets are inspected and durable shared storage is verified.

## Script-driven animation preparation
'''
text=header+'\n'.join('- '+x['cue']+' → '+x['action']+' Assets: '+', '.join(x['assets']) for x in actions)+'\n\n## Scene contact sheets\n'
