text+='''
## Reuse and compositing notes
- Character reference and subscribe end card: reuse; no new generation.
- All lettering, cue labels, exact clock hands, arrows, recurring-loop connections and five-question checklist: code-drawn.
- F01/F02/F03/F05: dark-on-light source materials; extract and invert luminance for white-reveals masks. F04: alpha watercolor overlay. F06: alpha particle overlay. Validate every matte; never assume real alpha from a checkerboard picture.
- No separate body-part rig requested. Use supported full-pose swaps rather than slicing connected limbs.
- Verify edges on both warm paper and obsidian; preserve opaque pale faces and notebook interiors.
- Safety sequence: pause, trusted support, documentation and safer planning. Do not illustrate confrontation as mandatory or a diagnosis as established.
'''
